'''Arcane Aegis''' is an [[Arcane Enhancement]] that provides a 3% chance whenever the player receives damage to [[shield]]s to regenerate [[Warframe]] [[Shield]]s for 12 seconds.

Can be sold for {{cc|1,000}}.

